{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logos/eb49b09290784443ec84538b06b4dffd.png",
  "description": "<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>About iCalm</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">At iCalm, we have created the world&rsquo;s first <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">all natural stress</span> relief 2 oz liquid shot! We are dedicated to revolutionizing the way people relax and find peace.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">Our mission is to help individuals manage stress and anxiety and achieve their full potential. What distinguishes us from other brands is our unrelenting focus on replacing negative emotions with calmness, peace, and relaxation. We understand that stress and anxiety can hold you back from living your best life. Therefore, we have developed iCalm, a powerful 2oz liquid shot that works in just a few minutes to calm your nerves, relax you, and put you back in control of your emotions. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">With iCalm, you can confidently tackle any challenge that comes your way without fear or hesitation. Our commitment to all-natural ingredients ensures that you can trust what you're putting in your body. We use only the highest quality components, carefully selected for their efficacy and safety. With our premium, fast-acting formula, you can experience unparalleled relief from stress and anxiety. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">Whether you're facing a high-stress job, a tough exam, or just the everyday pressures of life, iCalm is here to help you calm down and relax, allowing you to succeed in life!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">We are proud to be founded by an M.D and two Latina female entrepreneurs who are passionate about promoting natural solutions for stress and anxiety.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Product Description</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;\"> Our 2oz liquid shot was formulated after years of testing done by an Internal Medicine Physician and a PhD. iCalm's 2oz liquid shot is designed to help you feel calm, at peace while still feeling creative and focused within 20 minutes.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>iCalm is meditation in a bottle.</strong></span> We are the first product that acts on 8 key cellular pathways involved in stress and anxiety. We use 4 natural, clinically proven ingredients: <strong>GABA, L-Theanine, Taurine and Lemon Balm.&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Key Product Features:</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;\">MD Formulated</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;\">Made in the USA!</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;\">Vegan, Non-GMO, Gluten Free, Dairy Free, No artificial sweeteners, No artificial flavors. </span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;\">Non Addictive Formula</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;\">Non Drowsy - Does NOT cause sleepiness&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;\">We sell our 2oz shot in 3 variations. All 3 variations are available in the affiliate program.</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;\">8-Pack: $35.99</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;\">12-Pack: $53.99</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;\">24-Pack: $89.25</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(230, 126, 35); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">Join us on our mission <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">to help people unlock their full potential and live their best life by providing them with the most advanced and effective natural tools for stress reduction and stress resilience building. We believe that natural solutions are not only the most effective but also the most sustainable way to achieve optimal relaxation, health, and wellbeing.&nbsp;</span></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Payment Terms</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(9, 44, 76); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">At iCalm, we believe in fostering a community of passionate health enthusiasts and influencers. Our Affiliate Program offers a platform for collaboration and rewards our partners for their creative contributions. To ensure a fair and mutually beneficial partnership, we have devised the following payment terms for our affiliates:</span></p>\r\n<ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(9, 44, 76); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); list-style-type: decimal;\">\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Commission Structure: Affiliates will earn a competitive commission rate on every successful purchase made through their unique referral link or promo code. Our tiered commission structure encourages growth and rewards high-performing affiliates with increased earnings.</span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: disc; text-align: left;\">\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Tier 1: 30% commission on net sales (monthly sales up to $15,000)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Tier 2: 35% commission on net sales (monthly sales between $15,001 and $40,000)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Tier 3: 40% commission on net sales (monthly sales over $40,000)</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: left;\">\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Payment Frequency: Affiliate earnings will be paid on a monthly basis, within 30 days of the month's end. This allows ample time for processing any returns or cancellations that may impact commission calculations.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: left;\">\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Payment Method: Affiliates can choose their preferred payment method from the following options:</span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: disc;\">\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Direct Deposit (for U.S. affiliates only)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">PayPal (available for U.S. affiliates and international affiliates)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Venmo (for U.S. affiliates only)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">iCalm Gift Card</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: left;\">\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Cookie Duration: We want to really reward you for your hard work, for this reason our Affiliate Program offers a <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>90-day cookie duration!!!!&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: left;\">\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Exclusive Bonuses and Incentives: To further support and reward our affiliates, we provide exclusive bonuses and incentives, including:</span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: disc;\">\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Seasonal promotions with increased commission rates</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Special campaigns and product launch collaborations</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Performance-based bonuses for top-performing affiliates</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>",
